createJobForm.datasetFileFormatDescription:
Supports JSON (ShareGPT format) and JSONL formats:
• JSON: [{"id": "...", "conversations": [...]}, ...]
• JSONL: one JSON object per line {"id": "...", "prompt": "..."}

createJobForm.datasetFileFormatDescriptionChat:
JSONL: one JSON object per line:
• {"id":"...","system_prompt":"...","prompt":"..."}
• {"id":"...","system_prompt":"...","messages":[...]}
If messages is present, it replaces the entire messages array; otherwise prompt replaces the user message. Optional system_prompt replaces the system message or field.
